   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How it is formed",
     "texto": [
      "Take the feminine form of the adjective and add **-mente**: **lenta → lentamente**, **chiara → chiaramente**. If the adjective ends in **-e** or **-le**, simply replace it with **-mente**: **facile → facilmente**.",
      "Example: **Parla lentamente** (speak slowly)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Adverbs of opinion",
     "texto": [
      "**Sinceramente** (sincerely), **probabilmente** (probably), **certamente** (certainly).",
      "They express what you think about something."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
